commit 42415be9fc21018d48eda189a65103ad4c6fb484
Author: Van Tran <940988+vantt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Fri Jul 17 11:59:31 2026 +0700

    fix(runner): exclude .fgos/ from approve/return's working-tree-clean gate
    
    .fgos is a live store with its own write door, mutated by the very
    take/return/approve lifecycle calls this gate guards (each appends an
    event as part of the same call) — it never signals an actually-dirty
    code tree, so approve/return no longer require committing
    events.jsonl by hand before every call.

